news-item\">\n        <h2><a href=\"article.html\">跨境电商综试区再扩容 外贸新业态动能加速释放</a></h2>\n        <p>新增一批跨境电子商务综合试验区，海外仓布局不断完善，中小微外贸企业出海渠道更加畅通。</p>\n        <div class=\"meta\">2025-06-11 17:15 · 来源：华闻网财经频道</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"news-item\">\n        <h2><a href=\"article.html\">制造业数字化转型提速 智能工厂建设进入快车道</a></h2>\n        <p>工业互联网平台连接设备数量持续增长，人工智能技术在质检、排产等环节深度应用，生产效率显著提升。</p>\n        <div class=\"meta\">2025-06-10 15:40 · 来源：华闻网财经频道</div>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"news-item\">\n        <h2><a href=\"article.html\">新能源汽车下乡活动全面启动 县域消费潜力加速释放</a></h2>\n        <p>多款适合农村市场的车型参与活动，充换电设施加快向乡镇延伸，绿色出行理念深入人心。</p>\n        <div class=\"meta\">2025-06-10 10:20 · 来源：华闻网财经频道</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </main>\n\n  <aside>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;\">\n      <div class=\"side-title\">市场快览</div>\n      <div class=\"quote\"><span>上证指数</span><span class=\"up\">3,215.86 +0.72%</span></div>\n      <div class=\"quote\"><span>深证成指</span><span class=\"up\">10,482.13 +1.05%</span></div>\n      <div class=\"quote\"><span>创业板指</span><span class=\"down\">2,136.45 -0.18%</span></div>\n      <div class=\"quote\"><span>恒生指数</span><span class=\"up\">19,876.30 +0.45%</span></div>\n      <div class=\"quote\"><span>人民币中间价</span><span class=\"up\">7.1082</span></div>\n      <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#aaa;margin-top:10px;\">数据截至上一交易日收盘，仅供参考，不构成投资建议。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"card\">\n      <div class=\"side-title\">财经日历</div>\n      <div class=\"quote\"><span>6月13日</span><span>进出口数据发布</span></div>\n      <div class=\"quote\"><span>6月16日</span><span>工业生产数据发布</span></div>\n      <div class=\"quote\"><span>6月20日</span><span>贷款市场报价利率公布</span></div>\n      <div class=\"quote\"><span>6月27日</span><span>工业企业利润数据发布</span></div>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n</div>\n\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n  <div class=\"footer-inner\">\n    <p>版权所有 © 华闻网 · 未经许可 不得转载</p>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n\n===== FILE: article.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>全国多地推进数字乡村建设 - 华闻网</title>\n<style>\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body { font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; background: #f4f5f7; color: #222; }\n  a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }\n  .topbar { background: #b3001b; color: #fff; font-size: 13px; }\n  .topbar-inner { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 6px 16px; }\n  .header { background: #fff; border-bottom: 3px solid #b3001b; }\n  .header-inner { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 18px 16px; gap: 20px; }\n  .logo-text { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; color: #b3001b; letter-spacing: 2px; }\n  .logo-sub { font-size: 12px; color: #888; }\n  .nav { background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }\n  .nav-inner { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; padding: 0 16px; }\n  .nav a { padding: 12px 22px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: #333; }\n  .nav a:hover, .nav a.active { color: #b3001b; border-bottom: 3px solid #b3001b; }\n  .container { max-width: 1180px; margin: 20px auto; padding: 0 16px; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 3fr 1fr; gap: 20px; }\n  .crumb { font-size: 13px; color: #888; margin-bottom: 14px; }\n  .card { background: #fff; border-radius: 6px; padding: 30px; box-shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,.06); }\n  .article-title { font-size: 28px; font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.5; margin-bottom: 12px; }\n  .article-meta { font-size: 13px; color: #999; padding-bottom: 16px; border-bottom: 1px solid #eee; margin-bottom: 20px; }\n  .article-body p { font-size: 17px; line-height: 2; margin-bottom: 18px; text-indent: 2em; color: #333; }\n  .article-img { width: 100%; border-radius: 6px; margin: 10px 0 6px; }\n  .caption { font-size: 13px; color: #999; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 18px; }\n  .editor { font-size: 13px; color: #999; margin-top: 24px; text-align: right; }\n  .side-title { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; color: #b3001b; margin-bottom: 12px; padding-bottom: 8px; border-bottom: 2px solid #b3001b; }\n  .related li { list-style: none; padding: 9px 0; font-size: 14px; border-bottom: 1px dashed #e5e5e5; line-height: 1.6; }\n  .related a:hover { color: #b3001b; }\n  .footer { background: #2b2b2b; color: #aaa; margin-top: 30px; padding: 26px 16px; font-size: 13px; }\n  .footer-inner { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; }\n  @media (max-width: 800px) { .container { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"topbar\">\n  <div class=\"topbar-inner\">\n    <span>2025年6月12日 星期四 · 农历五月十七</span>\n    <span><a href=\"#\">登录</a> ｜ <a href=\"#\">注册</a> ｜ <a href=\"about.html\">关于我们</a></span>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"header\">\n  <div class=\"header-inner\">\n    <div>\n      <div class=\"logo-text\">华闻网</div>\n      <div class=\"logo-sub\">及时 · 权威 · 有深度</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<nav class=\"nav\">\n  <div class=\"nav-inner\">\n    <a href=\"index.html\">首页</a>\n    <a href=\"china.html\">国内</a>\n    <a href=\"world.html\">国际</a>\n    <a href=\"finance.html\">财经</a>\n    <a href=\"article.html\" class=\"active\">评论</a>\n  </div>\n</nav>\n\n<div style=\"max-width:1180px;margin:20px auto 0;padding:0 16px;\">\n  <div class=\"crumb\">当前位置：<a href=\"index.html\">首页</a> &gt; <a href=\"china.html\">国内</a> &gt; 正文</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"container\" style=\"margin-top:0;\">\n  <main class=\"card\">\n    <h1 class=\"article-title\">全国多地推进数字乡村建设 智慧农业助力乡村振兴迈上新台阶</h1>\n    <div class=\"article-meta\">2025年6月12日 09:30 · 来源：华闻网 · 作者：记者报道</div>\n\n    <div class=\"article-body\">\n      <p>夏日时节，走进广袤田野，无人机低空盘旋进行精准植保，田间传感器实时回传土壤墒情数据，智能灌溉系统按需供水……一幅幅科技感十足的农业生产图景，正在全国各地乡村铺展开来。</p>\n\n      <svg class=\"article-img\" viewBox=\"0 0 800 320\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMidYMid slice\">\n        <defs>\n          <linearGradient id=\"sky2\" x1=\"0\" y1=\"0\" x2=\"0\" y2=\"1\">\n            <stop offset=\"0\" stop-color=\"#a8d8ea\"/>\n            <stop offset=\"1\" stop-color=\"#fdf6d8\"/>\n          </linearGradient>\n        </defs>\n        <rect width=\"800\" height=\"320\" fill=\"url(#sky2)\"/>\n        <circle cx=\"680\" cy=\"70\" r=\"42\" fill=\"#ffd94d\" opacity=\"0.9\"/>\n        <path d=\"M0 210 Q220 160 420 200 T800 180 L800 320 L0 320 Z\" fill=\"#7ab648\"/>\n        <path d=\"M0 255 Q260 210 520 245 T800 230 L800 320 L0 320 Z\" fill=\"#5c9433\"/>\n        <path d=\"M0 290 Q320 260 800 275 L800 320 L0 320 Z\" fill=\"#3e7025\"/>\n        <g fill=\"#333\">\n          <rect x=\"300\" y=\"95\" width=\"60\" height=\"10\" rx=\"5\"/>\n          <line x1=\"310\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"295\" y2=\"118\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n          <line x1=\"350\" y1=\"100\" x2=\"365\" y2=\"118\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"4\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"295\" cy=\"120\" r=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n          <circle cx=\"365\" cy=\"120\" r=\"10\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"#333\" stroke-width=\"3\"/>\n        </g>\n        <path d=\"M320 140 q5 12 0 20 M335 140 q5 12 0 20 M350 140 q5 12 0 20\" stroke=\"#7ec8e3\" stroke-width=\"3\" fill=\"none\"/>\n        <rect x=\"130\" y=\"140\" width=\"60\" height=\"50\" fill=\"#c0392b\"/>\n        <path d=\"M120 140 L160 114 L200 140 Z\" fill=\"#8e2a1f\"/>\n        <rect x=\"580\" y=\"150\" width=\"80\" height=\"55\" fill=\"#e8e0d0\"/>\n        <path d=\"M570 150 L620 122 L670 150 Z\" fill=\"#9b8a6f\"/>\n      </svg>\n      <div class=\"caption\">无人机在田间开展植保作业（示意图）</div>\n\n      <p>近年来，数字乡村建设加快推进。各地依托物联网、大数据、卫星遥感等技术，构建起覆盖耕、种、管、收全环节的智慧农业体系。在产粮大县，高标准农田里安装了智能监测设备，农技人员通过手机即可掌握作物长势，精准安排农事活动。</p>\n\n      <p>“过去凭经验，现在靠数据。”一位种植大户告诉记者，自从用上智慧农业管理平台，化肥农药用量明显减少，亩均收益反而提升了两成多。当地还建立了农产品质量追溯系统，消费者扫码即可查看生产全过程，优质农产品卖出了好价钱。</p>\n\n      <p>与此同时，农村电商蓬勃发展，直播带货成为新农活。越来越多的返乡青年把直播间搬进果园大棚，让土特产飞出大山、走向全国。物流网络不断下沉，快递进村覆盖率持续提升，城乡消费双向流通更加顺畅。</p>\n\n      <p>业内专家表示，数字技术正在重塑农业生产方式和农村生活方式。下一步，应继续加强农村信息基础设施建设，培养更多懂技术、善经营的新型职业农民，让数字红利惠及更多乡村，为全面推进乡村振兴注入强劲动能。</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"editor\">责任编辑：王晓明</div>\n  </main>\n\n  <aside>\n    <div class=\"card\" style=\"padding:20px;\">\n      <div class=\"side-title\">相关阅读</div>\n      <ul class=\"related\">\n        <li><a href=\"article.html\">夏季粮食丰收在望 各地抢抓农时保生产</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"article.html\">农村电商赋能 土特产变身“网红”产品</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"article.html\">新型职业农民培训计划惠及百万农户</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"article.html\">高标准农田建设提速 粮食安全根基更牢</a></li>\n        <li><a href=\"article.html\">返乡创业热潮涌动 青年力量点亮乡村</a></li>\n      </ul>\n    </div>\n  </aside>\n</div>\n\n<footer class=\"footer\">\n  <div class=\"footer-inner\">\n    <p>版权所有 © 华闻网 · 未经许可 不得转载</p>\n  </div>\n</footer>\n\n</body>\n</html>\n\n===== FILE: about.html =====\n<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>关于我们 - 华闻网</title>\n<style>\n  * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n  body { font-family: \"Microsoft YaHei\", \"PingFang SC\", sans-serif; background: #f4f5f7; color: #222; }\n  a { text-decoration: none; color: inherit; }\n  .topbar { background: #b3001b; color: #fff; font-size: 13px; }\n  .topbar-inner { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; padding: 6px 16px; }\n  .header { background: #fff; border-bottom: 3px solid #b3001b; }\n  .header-inner { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; padding: 18px 16px; gap: 20px; }\n  .logo-text { font-size: 30px; font-weight: 800; color: #b3001b; letter-spacing: 2px; }\n  .logo-sub { font-size: 12px; color: #888; }\n  .nav { background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 1px 3px rgba(0,0,0,.08); }\n  .nav-inner { max-width: 1180px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; padding: 0 16px; }\n  .nav a { padding: 12px 22px; font-size: 16px; fo